  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei’s heart pounds when Nu Er Bao Xiong, Hei Fan, and Liu Liu Liu vanish from a phantom segment of the River of Time and appear in the present battlefield: an unbelievable killer move has pulled all three, rank eight experts of Northern Plains’ Huang Jin tribes, out of the past to fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1717
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_nu_er_bao_xiong",
        "char_hei_fan",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Liu Liu Liu kills Gu Liu Ru with a sneak attack near a qi wall. Crafty and scheming, he is called the disgrace of Northern Plains, since he never fights openly and instead bullies the weak while fearing the strong; his enemies suffer heavy losses without ever catching a glimpse of him, and it enrages them.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "disgrace-of-northern-plains",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gu_liu_ru"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same fate meets Gu Liu Ru in Fang Yuan’s previous life: woken by Longevity Heaven’s assault on Heavenly Court, he fights Hei Fan to a deadlock before a sneak attack from Liu Liu Liu kills him there as well.",
      "chapters": [
        1808
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "disgrace-of-northern-plains",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Liu Liu Liu is the only rank eight Gu Immortal in Liu tribe, and by custom that should have made him the tribe’s first supreme elder. His reputation for sneak attacks and for bullying the weak while fearing the strong is so poor that taking the position would have burdened Liu tribe’s own standing, so narration calls him an anomaly and a unique existence in Northern Plains history.",
      "chapters": [
        1736
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liu-tribe-succession-passed-over",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_liu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Of his batch of Northern Plains experts pulled from the River of Time, Liu Liu Liu alone survives, having already killed at least eight Heavenly Court members through long battle experience that lets him single out Fairy Zi Wei as a crucial target. His grey-knife sneak attack aims for her, but Wu Shuang intercepts most of the blow; the knife still pierces through Wu Shuang and stabs Fairy Zi Wei’s shoulder, killing Wu Shuang and heavily wounding her before Liu Liu Liu vanishes again.",
      "chapters": [
        1737
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killing-wu-shuang",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Liu Liu Liu tries to sneak into the battle again, but his concealment fails and his true body is revealed. Rank eight Gu Immortal Yu Zhu Zi, history’s expert most proficient at exposing concealment, restrains him.",
      "chapters": [
        1739
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "exposed-by-yu-zhu-zi",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yu_zhu_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Recalled again by call of the ancient’s phantom River of Time to Calamity Luck Altar, Liu Liu Liu has a delicate white face and a crafty look; seeing the scale of the battle, he jokes that he had better hide somewhere and vanishes on the spot.",
      "chapters": [
        1926
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Liu Liu Liu appears behind Duke Long and thrusts his signature killer move, Despicable Penetrating Blade, into his back; the grey light dagger pierces even Duke Long’s purple-gold dragon scales, the first wound Duke Long has taken since the war began. The blade sticks fast without moving further, and Duke Long turns and grips Liu Liu Liu’s head, revealing that he let the strike land on purpose to use his own body as bait. Duke Long crushes his skull, and Liu Liu Liu’s headless corpse falls as the grey dagger dissipates.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-against-duke-long",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "move_despicable_penetrating_blade"
      ]
    }
  ],
